# =============================================================
# Proprietary / licensed market data — must never enter Git history
# =============================================================
# The original dissertation source folder is immutable source material,
# used only to derive the artefacts under paper/, original/, and (via a
# local, gitignored data/raw/ copy) the figures and validated results.
# It is never committed, in whole or in part.
EC3400 Dissertation/

# Local copies of licensed data a user places for their own reproduction runs.
data/raw/
data/**/*.csv
data/**/*.xls
data/**/*.xlsx
!data/README.md

